  "why": "A small mixture-of-experts model under Apache-2.0, for gate A5: 6.9B parameters, 16 layers of 64 experts with 8 active a token, 93% of the weights in the experts. Attention as in Llama with no grouping (16 key-value heads for 16 query heads) and RMSNorm over the queries and keys, a softmax router whose top 8 weights are not renormalized, and an output layer of its own. 13.8 GB in bfloat16, more than the 8 GB GPU that passed A4 holds, so its experts have to stream from a drive.",
